---
// The meta-move: the site's visuals come from the owner's own stack.
// S.01 and S.02 are frames from ads generated end to end by Obscura
// (his pipeline); S.03 is the site's procedural structural drawing system.
import ProjectVisual from "./ProjectVisual.astro";
---

<div class="vs">
  <p class="vs-lede">
    The images below were not licensed or shot. They are frames from ads my
    own pipeline generated, and the structural drawings the site draws for
    itself. I pointed the tools back at the portfolio.
  </p>

  <div class="vs-grid">
    <figure class="vs-card">
      <div class="vs-frame">
        <img src="/studies/obscura-morning.jpg" alt="Frame from an Obscura-generated ad: a man beside a coffee maker in a bright kitchen" loading="lazy" width="720" height="1280" />
        <span class="vs-corner vs-tl">S.01 // OBSCURA RENDER</span>
        <span class="vs-corner vs-tr">FAL.AI &middot; SEEDANCE</span>
        <span class="vs-corner vs-bl">WEEKEND-MORNING SPOT</span>
        <span class="vs-corner vs-br">2026</span>
      </div>
      <figcaption class="vs-cap">
        A frame from a generated ad. The pipeline holds the same face and
        wardrobe across every scene, which is the hard part.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <figure class="vs-card">
      <div class="vs-frame">
        <img src="/studies/obscura-runner.jpg" alt="Frame from an Obscura-generated ad: a runner tying shoes in a doorway at dawn" loading="lazy" width="720" height="1280" />
        <span class="vs-corner vs-tl">S.02 // OBSCURA RENDER</span>
        <span class="vs-corner vs-tr">SCORED &middot; AUDIT-GATED</span>
        <span class="vs-corner vs-bl">COMEBACK-RUNNER SPOT</span>
        <span class="vs-corner vs-br">2026</span>
      </div>
      <figcaption class="vs-cap">
        Output only counts when a cold viewer gets the message. An
        ad-comprehension audit gates every render before it ships.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <figure class="vs-card">
      <div class="vs-frame vs-frame-drawing">
        <ProjectVisual slug="visual-studies" class="vs-drawing" />
        <span class="vs-corner vs-tl">S.03 // STRUCTURAL DRAWING</span>
        <span class="vs-corner vs-tr">PROCEDURAL &middot; TOKENS ONLY</span>
        <span class="vs-corner vs-bl">THE BRIDGE SYSTEM</span>
        <span class="vs-corner vs-br">LIVE</span>
      </div>
      <figcaption class="vs-cap">
        Every project plate on this site draws its own diagram from the design
        tokens. No stock, no screenshots.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>

  <p class="vs-credit">This site was built from my own knowledge corpus, and its visuals from my own pipeline.</p>
</div>

<style>
  .vs {
    padding-top: var(--spacing-10, 2.5rem);
  }

  .vs-lede {
    max-width: 52ch;
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .vs-grid {
    margin-top: var(--spacing-10, 2.5rem);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--spacing-8);
  }

  @media (max-width: 60rem) {
    .vs-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      max-width: 26rem;
    }
  }

  .vs-card {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .vs-frame {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    background-color: var(--color-surface-subtle);
    transition: box-shadow var(--transition-normal), transform var(--transition-normal);
  }

  .vs-card:hover .vs-frame {
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  .vs-frame img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .vs-frame-drawing {
    display: grid;
  }

  .vs-frame :global(.vs-drawing) {
    border-radius: 0;
    min-height: 100%;
  }

  .vs-corner {
    position: absolute;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.625rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: rgba(250, 248, 245, 0.92);
    text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(20, 16, 12, 0.6);
    padding: var(--spacing-4);
  }

  .vs-frame-drawing .vs-corner {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    text-shadow: none;
  }

  .vs-tl { top: 0; left: 0; }
  .vs-tr { top: 0; right: 0; text-align: right; }
  .vs-bl { bottom: 0; left: 0; }
  .vs-br { bottom: 0; right: 0; text-align: right; }

  .vs-cap {
    margin-top: var(--spacing-4);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: var(--leading-normal);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    max-width: 40ch;
  }

  .vs-credit {
    margin-top: var(--spacing-10, 2.5rem);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-border-strong);
    padding-left: var(--spacing-4);
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .vs-frame {
      transition: none;
    }
    .vs-card:hover .vs-frame {
      transform: none;
    }
  }
</style>
